<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>We'll Be Back Soon — Maintenance</title>

  <style>
    /* ===== Reset & Base ===== */
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body { height: 100%; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Inter", "Segoe UI", Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg,#1e293b 0%, #0f172a 50%, #0ea5a4 100%);
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
    }

    /* ===== Card ===== */
    .card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 760px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.04), rgba(255,255,255,0.02));
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 36px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: center;
      animation: floatIn 600ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1);
    }

    /* small logo area */
    .logo-wrap {
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      padding: 6px;
    }

    .logo {
      width:96px;
      height:96px;
      border-radius:14px;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.06), rgba(255,255,255,0.02));
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(2,6,23,0.5) inset;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    }

    /* Headline + text */
    h1 {
      font-size: 1.45rem;
      margin: 0 0 6px 0;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.2px;
    }

    p.lead {
      margin: 0 0 12px 0;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    p.strong {
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff7c2; /* soft highlight */
      font-size: 1.02rem;
    }

    /* loader + info row */
    .status-row {
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:16px;
      margin-top: 6px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .spinner {
      width:46px;
      height:46px;
      border-radius:50%;
      border: 4px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      border-top: 4px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.98);
      animation: spin 1.2s linear infinite;
      flex: 0 0 46px;
    }

    .meta {
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
    }

    .meta small { display:block; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.68); margin-top:6px; font-weight:500; }

    /* CTA / footer */
    .footer {
      margin-top: 18px;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:12px;
      justify-content:flex-start;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      display:inline-block;
      padding:8px 14px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg,#06b6d4,#0ea5a4);
      color:#042027;
      font-weight:700;
      border-radius:10px;
      text-decoration:none;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(2,6,23,0.45);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    }

    .muted {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    /* small friendly note box */
    .note {
      margin-top: 14px;
      padding:12px 14px;
      border-radius:10px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.018), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));
      border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
      font-size: 0.93rem;
    }

    /* ===== Animations ===== */
    @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
    @keyframes floatIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px) scale(.995); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
    }

    /* ===== Responsive ===== */
    @media (max-width:720px) {
      .card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align:center; padding:28px; gap:14px; }
      .logo { margin: 0 auto; }
      .footer { justify-content:center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="card" role="main" aria-labelledby="main-heading">
    <div class="logo-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
      <!-- simple SVG "shield" icon to suggest security / cleanup -->
      <div class="logo">
        <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M12 2l7 3v5c0 5-3.5 9.7-7 11-3.5-1.3-7-6-7-11V5l7-3z" fill="white" fill-opacity="0.92"/>
          <path d="M11 11l2 2 3-4" stroke="#064e3b" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <h1 id="main-heading">🚧 Temporarily Offline — Maintenance & Security Cleanup</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Our site is currently offline while we clean up spam and address some hacking-related
        and technical issues. We're taking extra care to make things right and to harden security.
      </p>

      <p class="strong">We expect to be back within a couple of weeks — thank you for your patience.</p>

      <div class="status-row" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="meta">
          <div><strong>Current status:</strong> Active maintenance</div>
          <small>Working on spam removal, security patches and stability improvements.</small>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="footer" role="region" aria-label="support">
        <div class="muted">In the meantime for any AP Physics 1 assistance, please contact me personally at takrishnasri@gmail.com. Response time will be within 24-48 hrs.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="note" role="note">
        Quick note: I understand downtime is frustrating — this temporary pause lets us remove spam,
        block malicious actors, and push improvements so the site returns stronger. 
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
